WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:02.580
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:05.720
Check it!

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.430
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.910
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:33.790
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:37.460
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:41.360
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:46.530
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:50.230
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.570
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:56.070
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:58.380
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.410
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.950
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:05.750
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.390
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:11.490
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.990
Everybody, loosey

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.500
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.900
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.340
Fly up, angel

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:39.010
The streets are as glittery as ever...

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:41.980
Damn sharks...!

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.370
What the...?!

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:16.590
Who are you?! Who hired you?!

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:18.590
Let the boss go!

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:23.130
Think you're hot stuff...!
You'll pay for this!

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:25.820
Hurry it up! You..

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:36.710
I see... You're one
of them "cyberoids"...!

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:38.910
In which case...

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:40.240
...take this!

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.440
All done!

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:50.180
What is this?

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:52.810
Special Fist Spaghetti!

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:59.850
<i>Why am I reminded of him now?</i>

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:05.160
Can I eat anything I want, Dad?

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:07.670
Sure! What do you want?

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:12.000
--A un-bio-processed hamburger!
--You're so silly!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.730
<i>Dad, huh...</i>

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.680
Hey, there!

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:20.410
Welcome home!

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:23.880
What're you doing there?!

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:26.280
Well, you see, Akio...

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:31.760
I'm in a bit of a pickle...

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:33.860
I need you again.

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:36.100
Again?!

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:39.100
We agreed that was the last time!

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:41.330
Don't be like that...

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:44.130
I know you got some money...

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.960
How long is this gonna take?!

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:11.730
There's nothing wrong with me!
Hurry it up!

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:17.870
Cyberoid surgery ain't that simple.

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:23.980
Tell him, will ya? I can't do
the operation if he won't listen!

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:27.480
Akio. The doctor's right.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:29.620
Just behave!

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:32.390
Sorry, Boss...

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:35.520
Sounds like he gets it.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:39.490
I have some perfect hand-me-downs
for this young'un.

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:42.660
You're gonna put used junk in my body?!

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:46.300
--Akio!
--But, Boss...!

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:51.300
I need your help. You know that.

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:57.510
Akio... You're like a brother to me.
I'm with you to the end.

00:05:57.510 --> 00:06:03.520
We're gonna make the guys
who snubbed and ridiculed us pay.

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:08.320
Be a man. Be a man, Akio...!

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:20.270
Hello? Sei-<i>san</i>?

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:23.640
Yes, I just bought some.

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:27.210
I'm on my way now.
Please wait a little longer.

00:06:27.210 --> 00:06:29.080
Bye.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.800
Is that--

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:40.220
Kyohei!

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.290
Akio...?

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.860
Is that y--

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:16.880
A... kio...

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:21.690
Kyohei! Wake up, Kyohei!

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:30.900
--Where are we...?
--The lobby of the ward office.

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:35.270
Talk about a surprise.
Meeting you on a day like this...

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:40.510
Same here. But I guess
we timed it badly...

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:45.720
Well, you always did have bad luck...

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:50.380
It looks like you're hurt.
Are you al..

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:01.170
Boss!

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:03.270
How'd you know I was here?

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:09.180
I asked that doc to modify you
so I could help if anything happened.

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:14.680
Relax. I'm the only one
who knows you're here.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:20.820
I'm sorry, Boss. I screwed up
and let him get away...

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:27.530
They're out looking for you.
Our boss got a notice, too.

00:08:27.530 --> 00:08:30.500
One asking for help to hunt you down.

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:35.600
Well, there's no fixing
what's already happened...

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:40.130
But you need to prove
that you're truly sorry...

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:44.480
Give yourself up, Akio.

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:47.410
Boss... I...

00:08:47.410 --> 00:08:50.080
Who's he? An acquaintance?

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:53.350
Yeah, a friend from junior high.

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:54.620
We ran into each other...

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:59.590
Alright. Let's talk in the car.
I'll go on ahead.

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:00.860
Kyohei!

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:05.350
Sorry to rush off like this
after seeing you again! Later!

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:11.840
--Now get in!
--Sorry, sir!

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:13.810
Hold on a second.

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:21.980
Boss...?

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:30.650
Akio!

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:44.700
<i>Forgive me, Akio. I'm the most
inconvenienced while you're alive</i>.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:49.110
<i>Me and their lieutenant
devised this plan</i>.

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:54.110
<i>We were going to kill both leaders
and merge the groups into one</i>.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:10:00.250
<i>So I had to off you
before the truth got out</i>...

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:22.140
Boss...! What's the meaning of this?!

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:24.130
The meaning...

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:26.970
...is THIS!

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:31.820
Akio!

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:33.650
Stay away, Kyohei!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:37.590
I'm done with you, you useless brat!

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:39.820
Now go to hell!

00:10:42.430 --> 00:10:44.420
Damn you...

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:47.930
Damn you...!

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.790
Akio...

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:41.790
I'm finally relaxed!

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:44.890
You sound like an old man.

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:48.030
To think Kyohei would break a promise...

00:11:48.030 --> 00:11:52.730
--And his honesty was his saving grace!
--It's 'cause you're always mean to him!

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:54.530
I bet he hates us now!

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:58.140
Look who's talking, you little demon!

00:11:58.140 --> 00:12:01.970
I'm not a demon! I'm an angel!

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:04.540
Sure, according to you.

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:06.070
Jo, are you eating?

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:11.350
Are you OK?! Isn't that spicy?!

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:13.850
It's good. Want some?

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:15.750
No thanks!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:19.220
Jo's the super-spicy angel!

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:22.730
And you're the super-eating angel!

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:24.430
Very funny.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:28.920
Jo! Give this sassy
midget angel a soaking!

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:37.110
Yes. About two hours ago.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:40.570
He was in front of that store
when I last spoke with him.

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:44.320
It happened near there?

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:48.280
That must have been him. Thank you.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.760
Jo.

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:55.360
Think you could get ready?
We're going to look for Kyohei-<i>kun</i>.

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:57.730
--Yeah, sure.
--Huh?

00:12:57.730 --> 00:13:01.290
What's wrong, Amy?
Does your stomach hurt?

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:06.470
(Help!)

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:09.000
What's with your mouth?!

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:14.740
That's what you get
for eating it anyway!

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.520
Akio... Aren't things looking bad?

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:27.560
Yeah... Totally bad.

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:32.020
But it's always been like that...

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:37.930
You know the score...

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:43.610
We don't want a fight.
We just wanna borrow some money.

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:46.650
Yeah! Borrow forever...!

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:49.750
Come on! Hand it over!

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:53.620
It's your parents', anyway!
Just get some more!

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:58.820
Consider yourself unlucky and give up.
Or would you prefer pain?

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:02.190
That guy looks pretty defiant
if you ask me...

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:03.900
Hey, you serious?!

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:06.000
You wanna fight?

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:08.770
--Akio...!
--Kyohei! Don't act afraid!

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:11.400
Tryin' to act cool, are ya?

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:15.570
--Don't mock us, kiddo!
--Please stop!

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:17.310
Ow...!

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:19.510
Ouch! Let go!

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:22.110
Quit gawkin' and help me!

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:25.750
--Stubborn bastard!
--Hey! Knock it off!

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:28.620
--So much blood!
--You okay?!

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:30.690
Oh man...!

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:34.960
--We gotta get you to a doctor...!
--I'll get you for this!

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:37.700
You're gonna pay next time we see ya!

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:40.260
I ain't gonna forget your face!

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:48.170
I thought you were
seriously awesome then...

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:52.040
Speaking of which,
you had spirit, too...

00:14:57.720 --> 00:15:02.190
How were you gonna take responsibility
if someone got hurt?!

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:06.020
You're a bunch of kids.
You CAN'T take responsibility.

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:08.960
That's why there are penalties!

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:12.160
Run around the campus
in your underwear!

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:17.170
Too embarrassed to?
Don't you underestimate the world!

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:20.340
Take responsibility for your actions!

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:24.040
People who can't do that are cowards!

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.880
I said go run! You lousy cowards!

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.950
I..

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:36.080
--am NOT a coward...!

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:46.000
--Who's he?
--Yikes, white briefs. How lame!

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.700
I like them.

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:51.500
--But why do you think he's doing that?
--Talk about dumb!

00:15:58.380 --> 00:16:00.550
Nobody else could do it...

00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:04.720
But we were all let off
because of your courage...

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:08.390
You've always been serious to a fault.

00:16:08.390 --> 00:16:10.320
I guess...

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:13.530
That guy, was he a <i>yakuza</i>?

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:17.960
Yeah, he's my boss, he picked me up.

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:21.670
But I guess he was the worst kind...

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:25.970
I even did this to my body...
I'm so stupid.

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:31.810
--Why did you join the yakuza...?
--Just happened that way...

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:34.980
--Give it to me!
--Stop...!

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:36.820
Give me it!

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:40.110
Stop! Don't!

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:56.230
You've had a tough life, too...

00:16:57.370 --> 00:17:00.310
This was my only choice.

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:03.340
There was nothing else for me!

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:07.710
Still... This isn't anything special...

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.620
The world is full of guys like me.

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:17.990
But there was something just a tad
different from the world you live in.

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:19.620
Just a tad...

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:22.660
This it?

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:27.500
Is this where the messenger for
that backstabbing Eiji is hiding?

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:33.070
Let's get out of here, Akio!
We'll be killed if we stay here!

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:37.670
--I have enough money for a little while!
--You're as good-natured as ever.

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:46.180
I don't plan to die easily.
There's still something for me to do!

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:51.460
According to Eiji,
he underwent a cyberoid operation...

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:55.290
...but tear him apart
and bring his head to me!

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:02.430
So long.

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:08.070
Akio! What are you doing?! Let me out!

00:18:08.070 --> 00:18:10.480
Don't, Akio! Don't go!

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.570
Darn you, Akio!

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:18.310
Die!

00:18:19.850 --> 00:18:21.940
As if anyone..

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.020
--would ever die when asked to!

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:46.640
Impossible...!

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:14.970
A... ki... o...

00:19:14.970 --> 00:19:19.170
--A... ki... o...
--Boss...?

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:25.380
You gotta be kidding me, Boss!

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:29.110
You got turned into that
so you can kill me?

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:36.600
This isn't good.
We haven't moved an inch.

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:38.760
Do you suppose there was an accident?

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:42.990
Sei. I'm gonna check it out.

00:19:50.510 --> 00:19:52.030
What the...?

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:03.620
I... kill... you...

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:06.790
Boss...

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:09.930
Neither you... nor me...

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:12.800
--...have any value alive...
--I... kill... you...

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:15.430
We're garbage...!

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:20.960
Let's both...
completely disappear... together!

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:30.310
Damn, you...!

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:37.920
Akio!

00:20:40.890 --> 00:20:52.640
<i>Farewell...
To the rain drops of sadness</i>...

00:20:52.640 --> 00:21:01.250
<i>Farewell... To the past that
I wash off without wiping away</i>...

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:09.210
<i>The drops come a little
at a time now</i>...

00:21:55.940 --> 00:22:03.620
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:11.260
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:18.970
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:18.970 --> 00:22:28.340
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:28.340 --> 00:22:34.880
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:34.880 --> 00:22:43.890
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:43.890 --> 00:22:50.730
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:12.090 --> 00:23:16.060
<i>Like a god, the power of science
produces demons of the future</i>.

00:23:16.060 --> 00:23:20.530
<i>As the terrifying invasion begins,
does no one realize that?</i>

00:23:20.530 --> 00:23:25.990
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"24-Hour Plot"
